SUMMARY:MISHAWAKA MARKET
LOCATION:Ironworks Plaza | 235 Ironworks Ave | Mishawaka\, IN 46545
DESCRIPTION:Join us for year 8 of the Mishawaka Market!\n\nThe Market runs 
 Sundays from 10 am - 2 pm\, May 31st through September 27th. *No Market o
 n June 14th\, July 5th & September 6th\n\nThere will be produce\, crafts\
 , baked goods\, food trucks\, kids zone\, live music\, animal adoptions a
 nd more!\n\nStage programming schedule will be posted before the 2026 Mar
 ket Season starts!\n*No market on June 14th\, July 5th\, and September 6t
 h.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/mishawaka-market/
