UID:b9c550f4cb7ae8d345e57c63@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260823T074859Z
SUMMARY:RESIDENT ARTISTS' SUMMER EXHIBITION
LOCATION:Fire Arts Inc | 305 E. Colfax Av | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:This summer Fire Arts Inc will feature the works of our residen
 t artists. We will be open throughout the Colfax Av construction project.
  Use LaSalle St to Sycamore St. to make your way to our non-profit. Pleas
 e stop by to celebrate the Michiana creative arts community. We are open 
 to the public on Wednesdays\, Fridays and Saturdays from noon to 5pm and 
 on Tuesdays and Thursdays from noon to 9pm.\n\nCheck out our webpage at\n
 \n*https://fireartsinc.com/\n\n*Instagram at https://www.instagram.com/fi
 reartsincsb/\n\n*Facebook pages at https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?i
 d=100042133547104\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/res
 ident-artists-summer-exhibition/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/resident-artists-summer-exhibitio
 n/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
