SUMMARY:SEITZ PARK SUMMER CONCERT SERIES
LOCATION:Seitz Park | 316 E. Colfax Ave | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Indulge in the vibrant sounds of summer and join us at our FREE
  Summer Concert Series at Seitz Park! Each Sunday afternoon (3-5pm) from 
 June to September\, you’ll have a chance to enjoy live music\, fun comm
 unity events\, and rotating food trucks with your friends and family – 
 just bring a blanket or chair and your Sunday afternoon plans are set! Th
 e performer lineup is as follows:\n\n- June 7 – DreamTeam Live\n- June 
 14 – The Motown Machine\n- June 21 – The Resurrection Blues Band\n- J
 une 28 – Happy Campers\n- July 5 – Hipposonics\n- July 12 – Mr. Z\n
 - July 19 – Zo Keys Band\n- July 26 – Now & Then\n- August 2 – Alli
 gator Blackbird\n- August 9 – Michiana String Collective\n- August 16 
 – Kennedy Kitchen\n- August 23 – Corey Ronell\n- August 30 – Ray Da
 vis\n- September 6 – Left Side of the Dial\n- September 13 – Memphis 
 Underground\n\nSee you there!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.co
 m/events/seitz-park-summer-concert-series/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/seitz-park-summer-concert-series/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
