SUMMARY:SOUTH BEND CUBS VS. WEST MICHIGAN WHITECAPS
LOCATION:Four Winds Field | 501 W South St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Game Highlights:\n\nLos Cabritos Maldichos Day\n\nContinuing th
 e celebration of Latin culture\, the South Bend Cubs will become the Los 
 Cabritos Maldichos for select games this season. Join us for special pre-
 game performance celebrating Latino culture\, Latin music\, popular Latin
 o food items and more.\n\nSunday Funday\n\nArrive early for a special aut
 ograph session with the South Bend Cubs players and play catch on the fie
 ld before the game. Gates open at 12:30 p.m\n\nPromotion:\n\nThe first 1\
 ,000 kids 12 and under through the gates will receive a CareSource backpa
 ck.\n\nShowcase Saturday\n\nA night dedicated to a unique theme or specia
 l appearance. Gates open at 5:30 p.m.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsout
 hbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-whitecaps-5/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-
 whitecaps-5/
